  "text": {
    "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
    "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-cc3049cb53@example.invalid",
    "text": "<p>ALLENDALE, N.J.--(<a href=\"http://www.businesswire.com/\" target=\"_blank\">BUSINESS WIRE</a>)--Stryker’s Spine division today announced the launch of its LITe BIO Delivery System, a hand-held device used to facilitate delivery of bone graft material to spinal surgery sites, which simplifies graft delivery, accommodates a surgeon’s preferred graft materials,1 and allows for direct visualization of graft placement.</p>\n<p>The unique design of the LITe BIO Delivery System provides surgeons with a single-handed method to deliver any type of autograft, allograft, or synthetic bone graft material without obstructing visibility. The innovative delivery tool provides tactile, visual, and audible confirmation of bone graft delivery, and the mallet-free system eliminates the impaction of bone graft.</p>\n<p><b>Read the full article:</b></p>\n<p><a href=\"http://www.businesswire.com/news/home/20161004005125/en/Stryker%E2%80%99s-Spine-Division-Announces-Launch-LITe%C2%AE-BIO\" target=\"_blank\">Business Wire</a></p>\n",
    "jcr:lastModified": "Wed May 31 2017 21:58:23 GMT-0400",
